{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tales from the Dancing Moon</i></strong> is a mystery adventure game inspired by portal-fantasy novels and UK culture, with a mix of casual life-sim and RPG gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of a <strong><i>shadow-beast</i></strong> invasion on the seaside town of <i><strong>\u00cfllisor</strong></i>, complete  villager quests, live life with sandbox life-sim gameplay, and find collectable diaries to understand your role in this mysterious character-driven story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/76fb11bd18cf632d7a342bcf83b11c1f.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong><i>The Dancing Moon Inn</i></strong> to the <strong><i>Stoknel Swamp</i></strong> regions. Explore both hand-crafted and procedural zones with seasonal and weather effects, providing different moods to the game as time progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/f1415b273f7308ff5acd231211da8bec.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your role in this story as you complete a variety of quests and collect hidden diaries. Unravel the mystery of the <i><strong>missing teenagers</strong></i> who arrived before you and their entanglement between the tea-brewing Magisters and the deadly shadow-beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/ce67e2c7eb225dfebde94a4c3521706f.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=1145 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about <strong><i>\u00cfllisor</i></strong> and it\u2019s villagers by pursuing various activities like <strong><i>side-quests</i></strong>, <strong><i>farming</i></strong>, <strong><i>crafting</i></strong> and <strong><i>fishing</i></strong>. Help rebuild the town from the recent invasion and get them back on their feet! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover your purpose and find a way back home? Track down those pesky teenagers? Or will you simply enjoy your time staying at The Dancing Moon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A character driven story inspired by young-adult and portal-fantasy stories. Told via quests and reading diaries scattered across the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A hybrid of RPG and life-sim with open-ended sandbox features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Questing, farming, crafting, building, fishing, cooking, combat - just to name a few things you can do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Season and weather effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free object placement and village building systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Both hand crafted and procedural areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Photo mode with many lens and filter options.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Act 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/a2e40df4721b2229ad5331e9e6687d1aa14f07fd.jpg"},{"name":"Act 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/e536eb62cff515d081d9ad71b3e6bca3df942389.jpg"},{"name":"Act 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/6062a6937502e72d1354de48dc3bf0dfc353a733.jpg"},{"name":"Finale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/e07b3eac76f2cefa68bb6365fe0dd19251bc77b5.jpg"},{"name":"Shutter Bug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/aac218921e80789fe4c9e602d18a361d3d5b507f.jpg"},{"name":"Restful Sleep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/d8020f68495e89fceb179a215f2760b6a2411306.jpg"},{"name":"Restless Sleep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/cc3990aa1bd17ba78acc209af7e704bd61ac90ca.jpg"},{"name":"Master Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/ed3f69d7c21457cddcbae5831622fd7a159df6a0.jpg"},{"name":"Construction Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/283dbda388026e601eea46bd5b02a27412df4f28.jpg"},{"name":"Master Fisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782420/ba52975035d6fdb437a7b2dc56bb2fd6f8061a7d.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1782420?t=1770821569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770821569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/6f3b97a32c2af61d2f618b1a25e19232cd4d5665/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770821569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/6f3b97a32c2af61d2f618b1a25e19232cd4d5665/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770821569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1782440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the first Act for free!</h1><p>Download the demo to play through <i><strong>Act 1</strong></i> of the story and side quests that give you a sense of how the game plays. The demo is also limited to the season of Spring. All your saves and achievements are carried across if you decide to purchase the full game.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tales from the Dancing Moon</i></strong> is a mystery adventure game inspired by portal-fantasy novels and UK culture, with a mix of casual life-sim and RPG gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of a <strong><i>shadow-beast</i></strong> invasion on the seaside town of <i><strong>\u00cfllisor</strong></i>, complete  villager quests, live life with sandbox life-sim gameplay, and find collectable diaries to understand your role in this mysterious character-driven story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/76fb11bd18cf632d7a342bcf83b11c1f.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong><i>The Dancing Moon Inn</i></strong> to the <strong><i>Stoknel Swamp</i></strong> regions. Explore both hand-crafted and procedural zones with seasonal and weather effects, providing different moods to the game as time progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/f1415b273f7308ff5acd231211da8bec.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your role in this story as you complete a variety of quests and collect hidden diaries. Unravel the mystery of the <i><strong>missing teenagers</strong></i> who arrived before you and their entanglement between the tea-brewing Magisters and the deadly shadow-beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/extras/ce67e2c7eb225dfebde94a4c3521706f.avif?t=1770821569\" width=1216 height=1145 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about <strong><i>\u00cfllisor</i></strong> and it\u2019s villagers by pursuing various activities like <strong><i>side-quests</i></strong>, <strong><i>farming</i></strong>, <strong><i>crafting</i></strong> and <strong><i>fishing</i></strong>. Help rebuild the town from the recent invasion and get them back on their feet! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover your purpose and find a way back home? Track down those pesky teenagers? Or will you simply enjoy your time staying at The Dancing Moon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A character driven story inspired by young-adult and portal-fantasy stories. Told via quests and reading diaries scattered across the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A hybrid of RPG and life-sim with open-ended sandbox features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Questing, farming, crafting, building, fishing, cooking, combat - just to name a few things you can do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Season and weather effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free object placement and village building systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Both hand crafted and procedural areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Photo mode with many lens and filter options.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DjMonkey"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782420/header.jpg?t=1770821569","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Tales from The Dancing Moon - \u00a9 2023 DjMonkey. Developed by DjMonkey. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782420/885856/fdb3df36eb47cbd3b193a4ab9805bad1276c1878/1750735694/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747124161","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782420/885856/fdb3df36eb47cbd3b193a4ab9805bad1276c1878/1750735694/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747124161","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782420/885856/fdb3df36eb47cbd3b193a4ab9805bad1276c1878/1750735694/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747124161","id":257136083,"name":"Version 1.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136083/2829f7af49de6260f272e0ff04fe1fe883c8bb5a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747124161"}],"name":"Tales from The Dancing Moon","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Tales from The Dancing Moon - $17.99 USD","packageid":639821,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1799}],"tit